OL,4,BUnbeaten Zverev hopes to be 'pain-     
OL,5,Bfree' after overcoming Fils at ATP     
OL,6,BFinals                                 
OL,7,GWorld number one Alexander Zverev said 
OL,8,Ghe would do "everything I can to be    
OL,9,Gpain-free" after hurting his ankle     
OL,10,Gduring his ATP Finals victory over     
OL,11,GArthur Fils.                           
OL,13,FGermany's Zverev ensured he finished   
OL,14,Ftop of the John McEnroe Group with a 6-
OL,15,F4 7-6 (8-6) win over Fils - a result   
OL,16,Fwhich also sent Ben Shelton through to 
OL,17,Fthe semi-finals.                       
OL,19,FHowever, the French and US Open        
OL,20,Fchampion's serve speeds dropped        
OL,21,Fthroughout the match and he repeatedly 
OL,22,Fgestured and grimaced.                 
